        IF `the store or concern has been sanctioned for a violation` AND `the store or concern incurs a subsequent sanction, whatever the length of the disqualification period` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "that has been sanctioned for a violation and incurs a subsequent sanction"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

