GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2021(h)(1) the Secretary must establish procedures for immediately suspending the processing of redemptions` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the procedures are established in consultation with the Inspector General of the Department of Agriculture` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The Secretary, in consultation with the Inspector General of the Department of Agriculture, shall establish procedures"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:1758 | Under the procedures described in paragraph (1), if the Secretary, in consultation with the Inspector General, determines that a retail food store or wholesale food concern is engaged in flagrant violations of this chapter (including regulations promulgated under this chapter), unsettled program benefits that have been redeemed by the retail food store or wholesale food concern—
-- src:1759 | (A) may be suspended; and
-- jural: the Secretary | a store or concern engaged in flagrant violations | power and liability: unsettled redeemed benefits may be suspended
@ref s 2021(h)(2) (src:1758-1759)
GIVEN `the Secretary, in consultation with the Inspector General, determines that the store or concern is engaged in flagrant violations of this chapter` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2021(h)(2)(A) the unsettled program benefits that the store or concern has redeemed may be suspended` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the Secretary, in consultation with the Inspector General, determines that the store or concern is engaged in flagrant violations of this chapter`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the Secretary's determination was not supplied
    WHEN JUST determined THEN
        IF determined THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the Secretary, in consultation with the Inspector General, determines that a retail food store or wholesale food concern is engaged in flagrant violations of this chapter"

-- src:1761 | (i) if the program disqualification is upheld, may be subject to forfeiture pursuant to section 2024(g) of this title; or
-- jural: the Secretary | a store or concern whose disqualification is upheld | power and liability: the suspended benefits may be forfeited under section 2024(g)
@ref s 2021(h)(2)(B)(i) (src:1761)
GIVEN `the program disqualification is upheld` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2021(h)(2)(B)(i) the unsettled program benefits may be subject to forfeiture` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the program disqualification is upheld` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the program disqualification is upheld, may be subject to forfeiture pursuant to section 2024(g) of this title"

-- src:1762 | (ii) if the program disqualification is not upheld, shall be released to the retail food store or wholesale food concern.
-- jural: a store or concern whose disqualification is not upheld | the Secretary | claim and duty: the suspended benefits are released
