GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2021(h)(2)(B)(ii) the unsettled program benefits must be released to the store or concern` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the program disqualification is upheld` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if the program disqualification is not upheld, shall be released to the retail food store or wholesale food concern"

