-- A date test: TRUE on 30 September 2017, FALSE on 1 October 2017. A spent deadline, encoded because the text states it.
`s 2021(i)(4) the report was submitted by the deadline` MEANS
    `the day the Secretary submitted the report` AT MOST (Date 30 9 2017)

-- src:1790 | (A) an evaluation of the impact of the pilot project on fraud described in paragraph (1)(A); and
-- src:1791 | (B) the costs associated with the pilot project.
