-- src:1793 | Any costs incurred by a State to operate pilot projects under this subsection that are in excess of the amount expended under this chapter to identify, investigate, and reduce fraud described in paragraph (1)(A) in the respective State in the previous fiscal year shall not be eligible for Federal reimbursement under this chapter.
-- jural: the Treasury | a State operating pilot projects | disability: costs above the previous year's fraud-control spending are not reimbursed
@ref s 2021(i)(5) (src:1793)
GIVEN `the costs the State incurred to operate pilot projects under this subsection, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
      `the amount expended under this chapter to identify, investigate, and reduce fraud in the State in the previous fiscal year, in dollars` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
-- A sum fixed by the text: the part of the costs in excess of the previous year's amount is not eligible for Federal reimbursement.
`s 2021(i)(5) the costs not eligible for Federal reimbursement` MEANS
    max 0 (`the costs the State incurred to operate pilot projects under this subsection, in dollars` MINUS `the amount expended under this chapter to identify, investigate, and reduce fraud in the State in the previous fiscal year, in dollars`)
